{
  "slug": "mcp-outline",
  "name": "Mcp Outline",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect Claude Code to Outline for document search, reading, creation, and management",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `outline` (Conventions and efficient workflows for Outline knowledge bases via mcp-outline tools)\n- **Agents** (1): `outline-explorer` (Fast agent specialized for exploring Outline knowledge bases)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `mcp-outline`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mcp-outline@claude-community` from `Vortiago/mcp-outline`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "agent": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
